 who wants to be a pirate king he  doesn't need school  and it's the same for eichiro oda who  decided to become a mangaka and i'm  definitely not saying forget about  school but it is nice to have reminders  that it doesn't have to be  that big of a deal because it usually  does seem like the biggest deal when  you're in it  but that appreciated cover story aside  we begin this chapter with something  pretty crazy right away we get a clash  between marco the phoenix and big mom  talk about starting strong and props to  marco for having the guts to initiate a  confrontation with iyanko  even knowing as he says even more about  how dangerous big mom can be  than the rest of them do prometheus  doesn't match up well with marco the son  homie gets hurt  by marco's usually healing flames  surprisingly and marco comments that his  phoenix flames are quite unique  imply that there's still more to learn  about his fascinating powers  so it appears like as far as commanders  go marco is a great matchup for big mom  however just as there might be the  slimmest chance of hope big mom flexes  srianco's strength  and grabs marco pretty easily by the  neck telling pero sparrow to finish him  off he prepares a candy bow and arrow  which is pretty sick not gonna lie  i don't know why but i loved seeing  archery being brought into it and even  though moments ago these two seem to  have an alliance now it seems that  perispero will execute him as an  enemy and really you can't even be  surprised by that there are pirates with  more honor no doubt  but in general you can expect pirates or  people in general for that matter to act  like this  someone as strong as marco seems  completely powerless  sweating and being unable to move pero  sparrow comments that he's wanted to  kill marco on different occasions in the  past  how ironic and in a sense this might be  ironic because the one time he didn't  want to kill him but team up with him he  actually gets the perfect opportunity to  assassinate him  of course he's interrupted by sulong  carrot and wanda  who give perospero a good slash right in  the face  wanting revenge for pedro thus still  leaving some hope for a future marco and  pero sparrow alliance that i'd like to  see  not gonna lie even big mom is shocked to  see the soolongs and you gotta admit  kerechon be looking good i do like  perospero's perspective here because  pedro blew himself up and perospero had  to deal with the consequences and now  people want revenge  because this dude blew himself up and  heard pero sparrow you can see from  perez pero's perspective why he's  annoyed at this even if our loyalties  lie elsewhere i do like big mom's  response to all this she comments on how  she hates being on the sidelines of the  battlefield and just leaves perro's  barrel there  saying they can all do what they want as  she books it to the main battle big mom  says that marco can try to kill her  another time  but she doesn't have any souls to use  against him right now  in my mind if marco wanted to prioritize  pero sparrow's defeat right now he'd  help the sioux long girl since pero  sparrow ain't no joke  but the sulang ladies tell him he can go  on ahead  and that they'll take peril sparrow out  and at least there's two of them now  because when it was just carrot chun i  couldn't see her having a fighting  chance but this does help their odds  without us actually seeing what road  marco decides to take  stay or leave he does notice people  screaming about becoming demons and he  can't help but wonder  wtf is going on then we jump into  another interesting matchup zorro and  drake versus scratchman appoo  and i don't like apoo i just want to say  that right now but to his credit this  dude holds his own pretty well  as he mentioned he has the antidote and  as a result  there is murderous intent everywhere he  looks but he can't give it to anyone  because he'll get killed if that happens  scratchmen survives zoro's attacks and  seemingly hits his own allies with his  fighting music this is a bad move  strategically for queen to make i feel  like dividing conquer is a strategy  that's often used for beating your  enemies in war  but here queen is willingly doing it to  his own side turning them against each  other and appu  again to his credit goes on to block not  only zorro  not only drake but both of them at the  same time  he admits that two on one is a bit too  much but the fact remains he's doing  better than i thought he would do  against the combined forces of these two  supernova and i do love the back and  forth hate  between drake and apoo which is  definitely suggesting that drake and  appoo  might end up settling matters by  themselves while zoro pisses out to join  kinemon and the others and queen again  comments about drake switching sides  when he was found out but again i'm  thinking queen should try to finish him  off himself  rather than giving him a chance to take  out another valuable member of their  team but whatever  queen clearly has his own style and even  if it's not the most  effective and doesn't follow the art of  war he is entertaining nonetheless and  knows how to make chapters hella  interesting and intense  i do like it when he mentions the  strategy of crushing luffy's second  and third fighters early on because that  is strategic we all know that if zoro  and sanji were taken out people would be  shook af  including luffy himself to be clear i'm  obviously not saying i want this to  happen we need  zorro to cut kaido but i just like that  queen  is being smart about this and that makes  for an interesting antagonist  notably he does seem surprised that  vinsmoke judge's son is on the crew so i  look forward to learning more about the  significance of this  and queen's possible past with judge  then we jump to chopper and brooke  and this is where things start getting  bad for our guys  at first there's some light-heartedness  with brooke realizing he didn't catch  the virus  because he doesn't have skin blood  vessels or body heat  since he's already the same as a dead  body he's not affected by it and then my  skeleton boy brook says and i quote  i'm a little offended by that fact but  regardless i'm invincible  end quote absolutely love that bipolar  statement and reminds me how much  i love brooke definitely one of my  favorite straw hats and just when it  seems that chopper is figuring out  something important about the virus  robin points out that chopper's arm is  freezing  and he didn't even notice and brook  again chimes in with a scream and says  and i quote chopper's done for end quote  this is a serious threat and it makes  the urgency of getting an  antidote all the more important but i  still couldn't help but laugh at  brooke's response  but yeah as if chopper getting the fast  spreading virus wasn't bad enough we  jumped to the fight against page one and  ulti  versus nami and usop and as we'd expect  our two straw hats are outmatched but  nonetheless  their spirits aren't broken they won't  give in to fear  usable captures ulti with an instant  kill  green star devil attack and page 1 frees  her  but implies that she probably didn't  really need his help to escape from that  attack  then usopp summons bamboo spikes from  the ground but this technique just gets  called borin which is bs because  it is a very cool technique but the fact  remains that our two flying six members  are unimpressed and ulti continues to  charge  the now crying usopp and man when usopp  cries  that gets to me because i know how hard  usopp is trying to be brave  and useful and it hurts seeing him come  short of his ideal  like in this case ulti headbutts him  with a skull cannon  completely shattering usop's skull  leaving him seemingly unfit for battle  and i do want to say  because it must be said that usop's goal  is to become  a brave warrior of the sea and he  succeeded in being brave in this  instance he knew he was outclassed but  he stepped up nonetheless  yeah he wishes he was more useful but he  still gets top grades in my books  for being a brave warrior to the end he  can totally be pessimistic and hard on  himself but man do i respect how far  usopp has come  but after chopper has the virus and usop  gets his skull cracked we're still not  done  my girl nami is badly hurt she's been  beaten to a pulp  and although i like boa hancock a lot  nami is right up there with her as a top  tier one piece waifu  and seeing her like this it breaks my  heart she is completely  powerless here and we want to protect  her through the page  but we can't we gotta just watch she's  admitting it's over that ulti won  she cries and begs for mercy she knows  that if she gets head-butted again  by her she'll die nami says many things  like that luffy is an idiot and that  she's sorry  and that they'll leave the island you  know usual nami willing to be  tricky to get out of a tough situation  but then ulti wants nami to say that  luffy will never become the pirate  king and nami is crying she's at death's  door  and seems to begin saying it usop  understands he wants nami to say it  he wants her to be tactful to save her  life she doesn't have to mean what she  says  however in one of my favorite moments in  one piece to date  she decides to say that luffy will  become the pirate king  definitely and man if you're not watery  eyed  right along with her right now then i  don't get you  this is nami the girl who originally  tricked and used luffy to serve her own  goal  the girl who outwardly acted like a  selfish person she is one of the coward  trio and the only girl in the coward  trio making us even more protective over  her  we know her she's good at heart but  she'll be strategic and say what the  enemy wants to hear  if it means getting the job done but  here she refuses to compromise  no matter how scared she is she will not  say that luffy won't become the pirate  king  even if it means her life and man that  is so sad  and beautiful at the same time as i said  one of the best  most touching moments of one piece and i  know that saying a lot but it's true for  me  this is characterization at its best  ulti is shocked and says if that's how  it is  then die usop tells nami that she's an  idiot and to run  and right when it seems like it's all  over tama comes in with her lion dog  komachio bites down on ulti freeing nami  and if we recall tama's animal taming  devil fruit powers worked on the smile  user speed  so she could actually turn out to be  very very useful here  and maybe even make some higher level  smile users  switch sides but i'm getting ahead of  myself the point is  and eight-year-old tama comes in wanting  to be a kunoichi  and completely saves the day nami cries  out to her and it's just such a  beautiful moment  obviously nami's been sort of a kunoichi  in wano and she just made an oath that  luffy will become the pirate king so the  title has significance for that epic  moment as well but the point is the  girls  shined so hard in this chapter from  carrot and wanda to nami and tama  it was amazing and as i mentioned tama  could be a real game changer  if we take into account her devil fruit  powers but wow what  a chapter a big mom versus marco clash a  supernova clash  chopper getting the virus usab getting  his skull cracked  and nami and thomas absolutely brilliant  moment  we didn't see luffy and i didn't even  mind because this chapter was so  so good there's a reason this is the  best-selling manga  of all time and it's because beyond the  fighting it has moments like this  which shake us to our very core anyways  let me know  your thoughts on this chapter and what  you expect to see happening next  if you did enjoy this review and want to  keep the one piece reviews coming the  best thing you could do is smash that  like button and share this video with  your nakama  if you haven't be sure to subscribe and  this is crucial hit the notification  bell and select all or you will miss  future one piece videos  if you haven't make this the day you  subscribe  and while you wait for the next chapter  to drop feel free to check out my  growing one piece playlist where i got  videos about supernova  warlords the yonko and much much more  link in the description and specifically  check out my longest video  ever on every yonko's backstory if you  haven't  since as you'd expect the way these  yonko got to where they are  is fascinating af and until next time  see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you

